  "utterances": [
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 2.43,
      "text": "Stonerill Roofing, this is Beatriz."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 2.8,
      "end": 10.53,
      "text": "Hi Beatriz, it's Sam from Vantrellis. I saw your team finished the Harlow Street job last week. How did that land?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 11.55,
      "end": 16.5,
      "text": "Ha, it was a sprint, but we got there. Thanks for asking."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 17.24,
      "end": 20.52,
      "text": "What's the biggest challenge with crew scheduling right now?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 20.97,
      "end": 27.17,
      "text": "It takes too long. Our office manager spends about six hours every week on it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 28.17,
      "end": 32.94,
      "text": "If nothing changes over the next six months, what does that cost you?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 33.75,
      "end": 39.95,
      "text": "Honestly? Around eighteen thousand dollars in overtime last quarter. And people are tired of it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 40.66,
      "end": 49.87,
      "text": "Our platform helps teams like yours schedule faster and keep everyone updated. It has mobile alerts, reporting, and integrations with the tools you already use."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 50.47,
      "end": 54.59,
      "text": "Right, and the thing that worries me is whether my"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 55.74,
      "end": 59.39,
      "text": "Right, right, so that's exactly what our dispatch module handles."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 60.54,
      "end": 63.41,
      "text": "Okay. What does something like that cost?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 63.82,
      "end": 73.77,
      "text": "It's twelve thousand dollars a year. But honestly, if you sign this month I can take twenty percent off, so it's really a lot less than that."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 74.72,
      "end": 77.58,
      "text": "Okay. I'll have to think about it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 78.43,
      "end": 82.09,
      "text": "Are you the one who makes the call on this?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 82.8,
      "end": 84.41,
      "text": "Me and Casey, mostly."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 84.93,
      "end": 88.96,
      "text": "Does what you've seen so far make sense for your team?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 89.63,
      "end": 94.58,
      "text": "Can you just send me some info and I'll look it over?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 95.53,
      "end": 99.18,
      "text": "Sure, I'll send over our deck and a case study."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 99.83,
      "end": 100.2,
      "text": "Great."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 101.32,
      "end": 103.12,
      "text": "Let's reconnect sometime next week."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 104.16,
      "end": 105.36,
      "text": "Sure, sounds good."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 106.15,
      "end": 108.32,
      "text": "Thanks Beatriz, really appreciate the time."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 109.32,
      "end": 110.1,
      "text": "Thanks, bye."
    }
